se, or soften your gaze, and let's turn our attention to the pelvis.": ["g9.mp3", 31.062, 5.451], "p:Settle in, and let the day fall away for a moment. Together, we'll explore the pelvis, one muscle at a time.": ["g9.mp3", 36.963, 6.609], "p:Take a moment to arrive. Feel the weight of your body, fully supported. When you're ready, we'll begin with the pelvis.": ["g9.mp3", 44.023, 6.638], "p:Let's begin. There's nothing to do except breathe and notice. Our focus today is the pelvis.": ["g9.mp3", 51.111, 5.81], "p:Now let your awareness widen, to hold all of the pelvis at once.": ["g9.mp3", 57.371, 3.72], "p:Feel the whole of the pelvis, calm and at ease.": ["g9.mp3", 61.54, 2.681], "p:That completes our journey through the pelvis.": ["g9.mp3", 64.671, 2.285], "p:Take a slow breath in through your nose... and let it go.": ["phrases.mp3", 0.45, 2.933], "p:Breathe in deeply... and as you breathe out, let your shoulders drop.": ["phrases.mp3", 3.833, 3.781], "p:Let your breathing find its own easy rhythm.": ["phrases.mp3", 8.064, 2.283], "p:Breathe in for a count of four... and out, slowly, for a count of six.": ["phrases.mp3", 10.797, 3.869], "p:We'll start here, with the first muscle.": ["phrases.mp3", 15.116, 2.076], "p:Let your attention come to rest on this first muscle.": ["phrases.mp3", 17.642, 2.856], "p:Begin by bringing your awareness here.": ["phrases.mp3", 20.948, 1.859], "p:Breathe in, and on the out breath, we will recenter our minds on the next muscle.": ["phrases.mp3", 23.257, 4.59], "p:Now, gently move your attention to the next muscle.": ["phrases.mp3", 28.297, 2.77], "p:As you exhale, let your awareness travel onward.": ["phrases.mp3", 31.518, 2.85], "p:Next, we come to another muscle.": ["phrases.mp3", 34.818, 1.927], "p:Let that area soften, and turn your attention onward.": ["phrases.mp3", 37.195, 3.038], "p:Breathing in, and breathing out, we arrive at the next muscle.": ["phrases.mp3", 40.683, 3.292], "p:Without hurrying, shift your focus.": ["phrases.mp3", 44.425, 2.076], "p:Now let your awareness settle somewhere new.": ["phrases.mp3", 46.951, 1.993], "p:Take one easy breath, and move on.": ["phrases.mp3", 49.393, 1.966], "p:From here, we drift onward.": ["phrases.mp3", 51.809, 1.726], "p:Notice any tension here, and let it soften.": ["phrases.mp3", 53.985, 2.485], "p:Simply notice how it feels, without needing to change anything.": ["phrases.mp3", 56.92, 3.563], "p:Imagine it growing warm and heavy.": ["phrases.mp3", 60.933, 1.92], "p:Let it rest.": ["phrases.mp3", 63.303, 0.832], "p:Picture where it begins and where it ends, and let the space between relax.": ["phrases.mp3", 64.586, 4.187], "p:Breathe into this area, and let it release.": ["phrases.mp3", 69.223, 2.3], "p:Let it be loose and easy.": ["phrases.mp3", 71.973, 1.387], "p:If you can, feel it gently lengthen as you breathe out.": ["phrases.mp3", 73.81, 3.041], "p:Breathe in... and breathe out.": ["phrases.mp3", 77.301, 1.66], "p:Stay with the breath.": ["phrases.mp3", 79.411, 1.062], "p:If your mind wanders, that's okay. Gently come back.": ["phrases.mp3", 80.923, 3.167], "p:Soft, slow breaths.": ["phrases.mp3", 84.54, 1.321], "p:Take one more slow, full breath... and let it go.": ["phrases.mp3", 86.311, 2.836], "p:When you're ready, let your attention return to the room around you.": ["phrases.mp3", 89.597, 3.384], "p:Gently wiggle your fingers and toes, and open your eyes when you're ready.": ["phrases.mp3", 93.431, 4.05], "p:Carry this sense of calm with you.": ["phrases.mp3", 97.93, 1.629]}}